<title>UK: EIB sets 600 million Danish crown Dec 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 600 million Danish crown Dec 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Den Danske Bank and Generale Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    600 MLN DKR   COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    15.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.71    PAY DATE  L-15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.71</p>
<p> NOTES	L LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
